<h3>1- Set up your selling account:</h3>
<p>First, you have to set up an Amazon seller account. This account comes with a user-friendly dashboard and tools through which you can organize your account, boost the product brand, and increase sales. While setting up the account, Amazon displays many rules and regulations you must follow. Once you have signed up for them, you can build the business. </p>
